' CIQ Voice Agent — current runtime behavior (phase/state machine)
' Render with any PlantUML tool (plantuml.com, VS Code PlantUML extension).
@startuml ciq-voice-agent-state
title CIQ Voice Agent — Phase & Conversation State

[*] --> Warmup : new session, no/expired baseline
[*] --> Survey  : returning user (valid baseline)

state Warmup {
  Warmup : agent makes neutral small talk
  Warmup : 30s biometric baseline records
}
Warmup --> Survey : baseline complete\n-> /survey-phase unlock + session.update

state Survey {
  Survey : asks BAT/CBT questions
  Survey : record_survey_response per answer
}
Survey --> ReportDelivered : all questions answered\n-> /analyze-report (deterministic SSOT)

state ReportDelivered {
  ReportDelivered : report context seeded
  ReportDelivered : on-demand AI reports available
}
ReportDelivered --> QAMode : post-report guardrail reconnect\n(strict report-only Q&A)

QAMode --> Warmup : Start New Survey -> reset_for_new_survey
ReportDelivered --> Warmup : Start New Survey -> reset_for_new_survey
Survey --> Warmup : Start New Survey -> reset_for_new_survey

note right of Warmup
  Reconnect (dropped socket) keeps the
  reached phase and injects resume context
  instead of greeting fresh.
end note

@enduml
